## Addendum 2026-09-15 (owner directive, session 910cbe15, in chat while the last Ezekiel primaries were in flight) - OW-19: LENS MULTIPLICITY. Single-lane review is BANNED. Two blind lanes are the floor, three are to be considered, and a third lane only counts if it is DECORRELATED

OWNER'S WORDS, VERBATIM, all three messages in the order they were sent:

> "would a tri ban review be even better down the road? lets make sure if we havent alertady alfuture chunkning ai consider either of these but do nto do singl review"

